creenshot5.png", "id": "190513696167216", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001687_190513699500549_814425097474291908_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wpC0X7Rs8EoQ7kNvwH3kDXK&_nc_oc=AdpeVijvozzgQiEvMkBTFO4AZcxmOkihFB1_Pfd8xsK--AmimCS-Nmru5yAn4YTg15U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwj35sJAo1Bj_VsPAOfACNGZz7uWBCeyNLwDp9K_9dEQ&oe=6AECA0D3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_cover.png", "id": "1195823440879067", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974917_1195823444212400_5305135154571797175_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8qtAynMW-ogQ7kNvwFmqLI2&_nc_oc=Adqgx_s4zHrP3fWoAgWY_eH8duzLdHmOGmaXmX1Sa3hrNZ880WT80M3yLcM7S4y2rrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_NtTxZXjxrY5CXwIvewCmjh9fdiQuVrw1H0Cm_t7dWA&oe=6AECAA22"}, "display_name": "Ajax All Powerful: Original Edition", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ajax (Henry Winkler) is a foul-mouthed, double-crossing genie addicted to the human souls he collects in exchange for granting wishes to gullible humans. However, something is different about the seemingly-naive little girl who has rubbed his lamp this time. For one thing, she\u2019s hired a strait-laced lawyer (Chris Parnell) to negotiate her wishes, and they might have a trick or two buried in the new contract\u2019s legalese\u2026.\n\nWritten and directed by award-winning VR creator Ethan Shaftel (KAIJU CONFIDENTIAL, EXTRAVAGANZA), AJAX ALL POWERFUL is an innovative VR comedy utilizing behind-the-scenes interactive triggers to create a fluid world of changing sizes and perspectives as the story progresses from the lamp to the real world, and beyond.", "short_description": "Ajax (Henry Winkler) is a foul-mouthed genie addicted to the human souls he collects after tricking gullible masters. But something is different about the little girl who found his lamp this time: she's hire